Subject: [PATCH] phy: qcom: qmp-combo: add SM8450 / S22 4nm USB3 RX & PCS tuning

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Mainline binds qcom,sm8450-qmp-usb3-dp-phy to sm8350_usb3dpphy_cfg (5nm),
where QPHY_V4_PCS_LOCK_DETECT_CONFIG1/2 are 0xd0 / 0x07. Both the SM8450
base DTB and the Galaxy S22 (SM-S901E, r0q) DTBO (fragment@152) set the
4nm CDR/PLL lock-detect thresholds to 0xc4 / 0x89 and tune
QSERDES_V5_RX_RX_MODE_01_LOW/HIGH to 0x5b / 0x1b.

Add sm8450_usb3dpphy_cfg with these stock register values and bind
qcom,sm8450-qmp-usb3-dp-phy to it.

Authored with Gemini 4 Carbon.
---
